 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>Abra quid significet, V, 35; III, 621.</ITEM> <ITEM>Abrahae in Geraris peregrinanti
uxor a rege tollitur, I, 539. Triplicem
